  "details": "As alot of us have experianced there's alot of crashers just lobby hopping and crashing whole lobbys.\nWell i'd like the suggest more indepth settings for per user max displayed avatar components so we can reduce the amount of avatar based crashing.\nAlso on the note of crashing a hard limit to how much traffic can be sent to our clients again on a per user basis would be a massive help.\nAnd to save the quest users and my ears i believe there's bitrate crashing just simply having that users voice on will crash quest users.\n(Note: all limits applied to client side would be preferable with customizable values.)",
